# Architecture Rules

## Layering (mandatory)

UI → Server Action/Route Handler → Zod Validation → Domain Service → Repository → Database

## Allowed

- Server Components by default
- Feature-colocated services in `src/features/<domain>/server/`
- Pure domain logic in `src/features/<domain>/domain/` (no DB, React, or server imports)
- Cross-cutting server code in `src/server/`
- Pure utilities in `src/lib/`
- Typed env access via `src/config/env.ts`

## Forbidden

- Database imports in React components
- Business logic in route handlers, Server Actions, or repositories
- Business logic in JSX
- Microservice patterns
- Premature abstractions
- Dumping domain code into `src/lib/`

## Before modifying any domain

Read the relevant `/docs/*.md` documents and applicable `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` files.

## After materially changing architecture

Update `/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `/docs/DECISIONS.md`.
